                ""
              ],
              "hash": "X-Amz-Target=WorkspacesService.ListAvailableManagementCidrRanges"
            },
            "description": "<p>Retrieves a list of IP address ranges, specified as IPv4 CIDR blocks, that you can use for the network management interface when you enable Bring Your Own License (BYOL). </p> <p>This operation can be run only by Amazon Web Services accounts that are enabled for BYOL. If your account isn't enabled for BYOL, you'll receive an <code>AccessDeniedException</code> error.</p> <p>The management network interface is connected to a secure Amazon WorkSpaces management network. It is used for interactive streaming of the WorkSpace desktop to Amazon WorkSpaces clients, and to allow Amazon WorkSpaces to manage the WorkSpace.</p>"
          },
